LICENSE / NOTICE
================

This repository packages FreeIPA for FreeBSD (a "Call For Testing" snapshot
of the net/freeipa-server and net/freeipa-client ports).

FreeIPA software
----------------
The FreeIPA software that these ports download, patch and build is licensed
under the GNU General Public License, version 3 or later (GPLv3+):

    https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0.txt

See the COPYING file shipped in the FreeIPA source distribution
(https://www.freeipa.org/) for the authoritative license text.

Port files in this repository
-----------------------------
The FreeBSD port scaffolding here — Makefiles, distinfo, pkg-descr,
pkg-plist, pkg-message and the rc/newsyslog helper files — follows the
FreeBSD Ports Collection convention and is provided under the BSD 2-Clause
license.

The patches under each port's files/ directory modify GPLv3+ FreeIPA source
files and are therefore themselves covered by GPLv3+.

No warranty
-----------
This is experimental, unreviewed work-in-progress published for testing
only. It is provided "as is", without warranty of any kind. See the README
for the (deliberately loud) "not for production use" note.
